			"notes": "### Recipe Book Overhaul (Advancements)\n- All custom recipes are now unlocked simultaneously with their vanilla counterparts by tracking the vanilla recipe unlock trigger. The only exceptions are unique items that do not exist in vanilla Minecraft (e.g., the Bell recipe still unlocks upon obtaining a gold block).\n- Disabled pop-up notifications for custom recipe unlocks.\n\n### New Snapshot Support & Recipes\n- Added support for **26.3-snapshot-1**.\n- Added all alternative crafting recipes and block loot tables for the new wood type - **Poplar**.\n- Added crafting recipes for colored wool stairs (including small variants) and colored wool slabs."
		},
